name=Photon Sword - Project A-Life
id=PhotonSwordALife
description=Brings Photon Sword to Project A-Life. A-Life NPCs who carry a melee weapon can carry an ignited photon sword instead (Photon Sword Chance, default 2%). They carry it dark, ignite it when a fight starts, put it out once it's over, and drop it when they die. A photon sword's guard (the ready stance, or a Photon Sword Forms block) deflects their bullets back through A-Life's own damage and soaks their shotgun blasts, and blocks their sword strikes, while an NPC with a sword blocks yours, or another NPC's, now and then. MIT licensed.
author=Dustin Hittenmiller
url=https://github.com/Dusteh/PZ_PhotonSword
modversion=0.1.0
